      "name": "Balance",
      "description": {
        "content": "The balance entity holds the total funds available in your workspace and can be calculated as the sum of its transactions (cash-in + cash-out).\nTherefore, you can also interpret Transactions as balance change logs.\n",
        "type": "text/plain"
      },
